\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fs20\cf0 Open the filter settings and hit the preview button in the right bottom corner. \{bmc Check.bmp\}\par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fs20\cf0 You'll see a window that lists all ZIP files that would be processed. If you click on a listed ZI\plain\f1\fs20\cf0 P file, you'll see its content.\par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fs20\cf0\b Files with a "+" at the end are encrypted.\par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fs20\cf0 \{bmc Preview.bmp\}\par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \par
\ql\li0\fi0\ri510\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fs20\cf0 If you want to have a more complete overview, hit the "Full output list..." button in the top lef\plain\f1\fs20\cf0 t corner. You'll see all files that will be extracted.\par
